    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the electrician is still looking at it now. he's being pretty cryptic though. he keeps saying it's \"bizarre\" and that the circuits are acting like they're being tampered with by something small, but we don't see any signs of actual sabotage or physical damage. honestly it feels like we're dealing with something we just can't see. have you ever seen cases where machinery just fails for no logical reason like this?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
